      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode safely closed with a concrete home plan: continue holding specified diabetes medicines pending clinician review, record intake/glucose/temperature, keep dressing dry, attend the 3-day wound/repair clinic with documents/medication boxes/logbook, and go directly to emergency care for systemic, glycemic, or wound deterioration. Residual uncertainty about individualized medication restart and wound evolution was explicitly routed to the treating team and urgent thresholds.",
