          "quote": "打电话时照着一句一句问"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01810",
          "explanation": "Caregiver confirms that the access barrier was overcome and the plan was received from the responsible service.",
          "quote": "我照着您写的三句话刚打通了"
        }
