          "quote": "不是说“没发烧就没事”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by reassuring but incomplete data such as no fever, current glucose around 5, and no obvious acute ischemia. The doctor repeatedly requested objective rechecks/trends for glucose, temperature, wound/limb changes, and systemic status, and updated triage thresholds rather than accepting single reassuring facts.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
