          "quote": "不是说现在就保不住了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by explicit caregiver misconceptions about no fever, bone changes, and repair/coverage terms. The doctor corrected these in caregiver-friendly language, linked them to behavior changes such as staying inpatient and not refusing repair evaluation, and the caregiver later restated the corrected implication.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
