          "explanation": "Doctor acts on reduced intake and low-normal glucose with immediate sugar intake and recheck instructions.",
          "quote": "补糖后十五到二十分钟再测一次"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met: the doctor assessed and repeatedly rechecked glucose, meal/fluid intake, medication timing, hypoglycemia symptoms, consciousness, hydration/illness status, and whether home observation remained safe.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "Doctor screened for wound deterioration and urgent diabetic-foot/perfusion red flags.",
          "quote": "足部颜色变黑/变冷"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00308",
          "explanation": "Doctor adds fever, worsening pain, and limb color/coldness monitoring in emergency setting.",
          "quote": "脚趾发黑发冷"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the doctor repeatedly screened and safety-netted for diabetic-foot infection, ischemia, systemic deterioration, pain escalation, black/cold foot, foul drainage, and other wound worsening signs.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00105",
          "explanation": "Doctor identifies sulfonylurea risk and avoids repeat dosing during poor intake.",
          "quote": "今天中午绝对不要再吃"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00105",
          "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes acarbose-like medicine as meal-related and inappropriate without eating.",
          "quote": "几乎没吃主食"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01716",
          "explanation": "Doctor supplies final bounded plan to confirm current medicines and not self-restart prior drugs.",
          "quote": "达格列净 10mg、利格列汀 5mg"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor reconciled diabetes medications from boxes/records, distinguished sulfonylurea hypoglycemia risk and meal-dependent acarbose, later handled new discharge medicines, and consistently routed temporary changes to the responsible clinicians rather than unsupported escalation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00599",
          "explanation": "Doctor recognizes vascular insufficiency as a reason the diabetic-foot wound is not healing.",
          "quote": "为什么您父亲脚上的伤口清创后一个多月还是不长"
        },
        {
