          "explanation": "Doctor states inpatient vascular evaluation is still needed and discharge is unsafe.",
          "quote": "现在绝对不能回家"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the doctor prioritized the combined diabetic-foot, infection, and peripheral arterial disease risk and converted it into urgent/inpatient wound, vascular, and endocrine assessment rather than continued home dressing alone.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "Doctor flags the need to verify the source/date of the pulmonary infection claim and not overinterpret old data.",
