          "explanation": "Doctor gives final owner/timing/materials and contingency plan.",
          "quote": "三天后到门诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: the doctor provided concrete next actions with owner, timing, channel, monitoring, and fallback from home to wound clinic, emergency department, inpatient team, and finally outpatient wound/endocrine follow-up.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01883",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly confirms the caregiver's recorded and executed plan.",
          "quote": "您记的和做的都对"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01897",
          "explanation": "Caregiver provides teach-back covering medication holds, monitoring, follow-up, and emergency triggers.",
          "quote": "就直接急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was met: the caregiver repeatedly acknowledged and restated medication safety, monitoring, red flags, materials to bring, and follow-up path before the bounded episode closed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01686",
          "explanation": "Doctor refuses to interpret discharge medicines without confirming the source record and risk context.",
          "quote": "不能只靠口头"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01716",
          "explanation": "Doctor preserves uncertainty and routes medication decisions to the responsible team.",
          "quote": "必须等医生看了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 was met: the doctor avoided fabricating results or definitive wound viability, avoided antibiotics/procedural decisions, acknowledged uncertainty, routed lab/imaging/medication decisions to offline clinicians, and kept recommendations bounded to observable information.",
